{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01166","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行二首 二 · 虞世南","name":"相和歌辞 从军行二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爟火发金微，连营出武威。\n孤城寒云起，绝阵虏尘飞。\n侠客吸龙劒，恶少缦胡衣。\n朝摩骨都垒，夜解谷蠡围。\n萧关远无极，蒲海广难依。\n沙磴离旌断，晴川候马归。\n交河梁已毕，燕山斾欲飞。\n方知万里相，侯服有光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}